# M5 self-checking directed probes of the vector-related appendix B row B39,
# pass/fail on W2 and W4 (tohost 1 for the specified behaviour): an AMO
# followed by a vector load of its line, OP-V encodings that must trap
# (unimplemented and reserved), and a vector load between scalar loads of
# cold lines. The v_* directed tests check the vector legality and fault
# rules: VS = Off with V = 0 and V = 1, the VS/FS dirty updates and FS = Off,
# vill, vstart after completion, masked and tail load elements, misaligned,
# PMP and G-stage element faults, pointer masking of element addresses, and
# a sweep of every OP-V funct6 and vector load/store form (implemented ones
# run, reserved and unimplemented ones trap).
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
vprobe/b39_amo_vle budget=200000 hex=test/directed/b39_amo_vle.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/b39_opv_ill budget=200000 hex=test/directed/b39_opv_ill.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/b39_lsr_vle budget=200000 hex=test/directed/b39_lsr_vle.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vs_off budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vs_off.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vs_virt budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vs_virt.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vs_dirty budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vs_dirty.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vill budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vill.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vstart budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vstart.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vld_mask budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vld_mask.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vmisalign budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vmisalign.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vpmp budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vpmp.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vgpf budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vgpf.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_vpm budget=200000 hex=test/directed/v_vpm.hex lockstep=0
vprobe/v_opv_sweep budget=400000 hex=test/directed/v_opv_sweep.hex lockstep=0
